SUMMARY:14TH ANNUAL MICHIANA RENAISSANCE FESTIVAL
LOCATION:St. Joseph County Fairgrounds | 5117 South Ironwood Drive | South 
 Bend\, IN 46614
DESCRIPTION:Step into the Past at the Michiana Renaissance Festival!\n\nExp
 erience a weekend of wonder\, excitement\, and history the whole family w
 ill enjoy! Explore four immersive reenactment areas\, indulge in deliciou
 s food and drink\, and be amazed by thrilling falconry and jousting tourn
 aments. With six stages of nonstop entertainment\, interactive shows\, an
 d a bustling marketplace full of unique vendors\, there's truly something
  for everyone. Don't miss the adventure - join us at the Michiana Renaiss
 ance Festival!\n\nURLs:\nTickets: https://go.evvnt.com/3496731-0?pid=6556
 \nFacebook: https://go.evvnt.com/3496731-2?pid=6556\n\nDate and Time: Sat
 urday\, August 29th - Sunday\, August 30 from 10 am - 6 pm eastern\n\nVen
 ue details: St. Joseph County Fairgrounds\, 5117 South Ironwood Drive\, S
 outh Bend\, Indiana\, 46614\, United States\n\nPrices:\nGeneral Admission
 : USD 15.00\nSenior: USD 12.00\nKids 6-12: USD 7.00\nActive and Retired M
 ilitary (Free): USD 0.00\nChildren 5 and Under (Free): USD 0.00\n\nMore I
 nfo: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/14th-annual-michiana-renaissan
 ce-festival/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/14th-annual-michiana-renaissance-
 festival/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260829T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260829T180000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
