LOCATION:Century Center Convention Center | 120 S Doctor M.L.K. Jr Blvd | S
 outh Bend\, 46601
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the World Dance Showdown. We are a weekend danc
 e event in Indiana for line dancers\, couples\, dance teams and choreogra
 phers holding dance workshops and dance competitions all weekend. Beginne
 r to Advanced dancers welcome. Over 150 Workshops. Seven workshops to cho
 ose from each hour. Line\, Pattern Partner\, Couples (West Coast Swing\, 
 East Coast Swing\, Hustle\, Country Two Step\, Country Swing\, Night Club
  2-Step\, Cha Cha\, Dance Technique\, Presentation and Style workshops) a
 nd NTA Instructor workshops. All workshops are included in your pass (NO 
 PAID workshops at our event). Workshops begin on Thursday at 1:00 pm and 
 go until 3:00 pm on Sunday. Line\, Couples\, Choreography and Team Compet
 itions are on Friday and Saturday. Four Ballrooms for Open Dancing includ
 ing a dedicated Couples Ballroom\, a dedicated WCS Ballroom\, a dedicated
  Line Dance Ballroom and an All Request Ballroom. Come and join us for a 
 FUN TIME!! http://www.worlddanceshowdown....\n\nMore Info: https://www.vi
 sitsouthbend.com/events/2026-world-dance-showdown/
