DTSTAMP:20260828T215731Z
SUMMARY:NATURE JOURNALING CLUB
LOCATION:St. Patrick's County Park: Berta Shelter | 50651 Laurel Road | Sou
 th Bend\, IN 46637
DESCRIPTION:Join a naturalist in a creative space for adults (18+) who love
  exploring the outdoors and capturing its beauty through art and words. T
 his beginner-friendly club is all about slowing down\, observing nature\,
  and connecting with other nature lovers. Bring your favorite journal\, c
 uriosity\, and a sense of wonder – we’ll provide inspiration using wr
 iting prompts and tips on how to use mixed media such as pencil\, paint\,
  photography\, and collage.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/
 events/nature-journaling-club/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/nature-journaling-club/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260829T100000
