BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:af760464630f183d60952760@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260828T215731Z
SUMMARY:NEW CARLISLE BEER AND WINE WALK
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our 13th Annual Beer & Wine Walk as we celebrate th
 e nation's Semiquincentennial- Cheers to 250 Years! The event is on Satur
 day\, August 29th from 5 - 9 pm eastern. Sample beer and wine at several 
 local restaurants and businesses in New Carlisle and Hudson Lake. This is
  a 21 and over event. Tickets are $35.00 for drinkers and $15 for designa
 ted drivers. If you purchase tickets ahead of time\, we are offering an a
 dvanced wristband pick up day on Wednesday\, August 26th at Studebaker Br
 ewing Co. (110 E. Michigan St.) from 6 - 8 pm eastern or pick up the day 
 of the event at the New Carlisle Fire Station (204 E. Michigan St.) start
 ing at 4:30 pm until 8:00 pm eastern. You can also purchase tickets the d
 ay of. You will need to show your ID for wristband. You will receive a sa
 mple cup with your wristband. Trolleys will be available for transportati
 on. The event is a fundraiser for Discover New Carlisle\, Inc. for their 
 facade grant program and other beautification projects. E-mail admin@disc
 overnewcarlisle.com with any questions.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitso
 uthbend.com/events/new-carlisle-beer-and-wine-walk/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/new-carlisle-beer-and-wine-walk/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260829T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260829T210000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f64547b09ded55c436186351@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260828T215731Z
SUMMARY:NOTRE DAME SHAKESPEARE FESTIVAL - MACBETH
LOCATION:Patricia George Decio Theatre\, DeBartolo Performing Arts Center
DESCRIPTION:It's Shakespeare like you've never seen before. The 2026 Notre 
