SUMMARY:SOUTH BEND ROLLER DERBY - CROSSROADS CARNAGE TOURNAMENT
LOCATION:St. Joseph County 4-H Fairgrounds | 5265 S Ironwood Rd | South Ben
 d\, 46614
DESCRIPTION:South Bend Roller Derby is excited to announce we will be hosti
 ng the inaugural Crossroads Carnage Tournament!!\nDate: August 28-30\, 20
 26 (Times above are subject to change)\nVenue: St Joseph County Fairgroun
 ds\n5117 S Ironwood Dr\, South Bend\, Indiana 46614\nThis tournament will
  be comprised of 12 sanctioned and/or regulation games on a single track 
 of polished concrete over the 3-day weekend event. 2 games will be played
  Friday evening\, and the remaining 10 will be split between Saturday and
  Sunday. Each team will be promised 3 games.\nIt is a round-robin style o
 f tournament\, with all games being pre-set and assigned beforehand.\n\nT
 icket Information: https://www.zeffy.com/.../2026-crossroads-carnage-tour
 nament\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-rol
 ler-derby-crossroads-carnage-tournament/
