DESCRIPTION:Grindtime Indiana Pro Wrestling f.k.a. Revolution Championship 
 Wrestling returns to Four Winds Field on Saturday August 29\, 2026 as we 
 present SWINGING FOR THE FENCES 2!\n\nGates open at 5pm with a Meet and G
 reet with all the wrestlers and bell time is 7pm!\n\nSpecial guests annou
 nced thus far are former AEW Superstar and member of the Jurassic Express
  MARKO STUNT and former WWE and AEW Superstar PARKER BOUDREAUX!!!\nMore s
 pecial guests will be announced soon!\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsout
 hbend.com/events/swing-for-the-fences-ii/
